{"name":"GRS Instagram","tag":"div","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Small title"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading"},{"type":"textarea","id":"text","label":"Text"},{"type":"text","id":"handle","label":"Account name"},{"type":"url","id":"profile_url","label":"Instagram profile link"},{"type":"text","id":"button_label","label":"Button label"},{"type":"paragraph","content":"Latest posts: the Instafeed app block in this section shows your real Instagram posts. Number of posts, layout and the account are set in the Instafeed app. The photo blocks are only shown if the Instafeed block is removed."},{"type":"header","content":"Layout and sizes","info":"100% keeps the original design."},{"type":"range","id":"content_width","label":"Content width","min":800,"max":1800,"step":20,"default":1440,"unit":"px"},{"type":"range","id":"space_top","label":"Space above","min":0,"max":200,"step":5,"default":100,"unit":"%"},{"type":"range","id":"space_bottom","label":"Space below","min":0,"max":200,"step":5,"default":100,"unit":"%"},{"min":50,"max":200,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100,"type":"range","id":"image_height","label":"Photo size (computer)"},{"min":50,"max":200,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100,"type":"range","id":"image_height_mobile","label":"Photo size (phone and tablet)"},{"type":"header","content":"Text sizes and style","info":"Sizes are set separately for computers and phones. 100% keeps the original design."},{"min":50,"max":200,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100,"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size","label":"Small title size (computer)"},{"min":50,"max":200,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100,"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size_mobile","label":"Small title size (phone)"},{"min":50,"max":200,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100,"type":"range","id":"heading_size","label":"Heading size (computer)"},{"min":50,"max":200,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100,"type":"range","id":"heading_size_mobile","label":"Heading size (phone)"},{"type":"select","id":"hea